{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is ROLLA?</strong><br><br><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/04c718cd65a9bf1a2d070e05090e539e.poster.avif?t=1761035675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/04c718cd65a9bf1a2d070e05090e539e.webm?t=1761035675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/04c718cd65a9bf1a2d070e05090e539e.mp4?t=1761035675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROLLA is B-movie inspired horror game with chunky lowres awesomeness where gameplay is somewhere around run based fast destruction survival game, twin stick shooter and collectathon. Roll, eat people, when you grow bigger, eat buildings, when you get even bigger, then?? But be careful, enemies and their guns will make you smaller. Mostly everything is destroyable and that is the point of the game, cause chaos, destroy everything, grow bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level in different locations around the world has separate goals too, some simple, some more hidden and tricky.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/b97b407ce708eb9432fbe07faebefa1f.poster.avif?t=1761035675\" aria-label=\"ROLLA destroying buildings\" width=520 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/b97b407ce708eb9432fbe07faebefa1f.webm?t=1761035675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/b97b407ce708eb9432fbe07faebefa1f.mp4?t=1761035675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics that help you:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smaller ROLLA is, faster it moves. Bigger rolla can survive more hits and destroy everything, but is an easy target for airstrikes. ROLLA can DASH, and also SNATCH people from distance. There will be different powerups / mutations available on different stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/9f798fc768fb2002317767d5c4d6a553.poster.avif?t=1761035675\" aria-label=\"ROLLA in football field\" width=520 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/9f798fc768fb2002317767d5c4d6a553.webm?t=1761035675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/9f798fc768fb2002317767d5c4d6a553.mp4?t=1761035675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>- Easy control scheme of only one stick of joypad + couple buttons or just keyboard or keyboard+mouse <br>- Retro inspired stylized graphics where everything can be destroyed <br>- Different locations around the world <br>- Lots of special tasks on every level <br>- Fast paced fun to play just to see things break or eating couple of humans, or completing goals and unlocking new levels and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/14b622882791dac8a98738ec65db0dd8.poster.avif?t=1761035675\" aria-label=\"ROLLA eating in desert\" width=520 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/14b622882791dac8a98738ec65db0dd8.webm?t=1761035675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/14b622882791dac8a98738ec65db0dd8.mp4?t=1761035675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975830?t=1761035675","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975830?t=1761035675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/7b6b37106a8691166623afde3a0397204cb986b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761035675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/7b6b37106a8691166623afde3a0397204cb986b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761035675","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4000120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is ROLLA?</strong><br><br><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/04c718cd65a9bf1a2d070e05090e539e.poster.avif?t=1761035675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/04c718cd65a9bf1a2d070e05090e539e.webm?t=1761035675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975830/extras/04c718cd65a9bf1a2d070e05